  "options": [
    {
      "id": "IZ0Om",
      "text": "<math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow></msub></math> is formed by heating <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msub></math> to <math><mn>170</mn><mo>°</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></math>",
