    {
      "id": "A7YR1",
      "text": "<math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow></msub></math> is stable to heat",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": true
    },
    {
      "id": "oRWhg",
      "text": "<math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow></msub></math> is used in the estimation of CO",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "agUpl",
      "text": "<math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></math> combines with <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msub></math> to form <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></msub><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>9</mn></mrow></msub></math> . When heated above <math><mn>75</mn><mo>°</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></math> , it <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></msub><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>9</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></mfenced></math> decomposes to form <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow></msub></math>",
