  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "Here statement B is incorrect as <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow></msub></math> is unstable to heat <br/>It decomposes when heated to <math><mn>300</mn><mo>°</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></math> . <br/><math><mn>2</mn><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow></msub><mover accent=\"false\"><mo>→</mo><mrow><mn>300</mn><mo>°</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></mrow></mover><mn>2</mn><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></math>  <br/>Rest other statements are correct as follows <br/>(i) <math><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msub><mover accent=\"false\"><mo>→</mo><mrow><mn>170</mn><mo>°</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></mrow></mover><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></math>  <br/>(iii) <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow></msub></math> oxidizes CO to <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></math> quantitatively at room temperature, liberating <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></math> , which can be titrated with sodium thiosulphate. <br/><math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mo>→</mo><mn>5</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></math>  <br/>(iv) <math><mn>2</mn><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msub><mo>→</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></msub><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>9</mn></mrow></msub></math>  <br/><math><mn>4</mn><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></msub><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>9</mn></mrow></msub><mover accent=\"false\"><mo>→</mo><mrow><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>75</mn><mo>°</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></mrow></mover><mn>6</mn><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></math>",
